<section class="page-heading"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">OUR STORY</span><h1>Made for sharing</h1><p>Good ingredients. Thoughtful cooking. Genuine hospitality.</p></div></section>
<section class="container section-pad narrow-copy"><h2 class="section-title">Food that brings us together</h2><p>At Saffron & Stone, we believe the best meals are the ones shared. Our kitchen celebrates seasonal produce, familiar comfort and flavours inspired by kitchens around the world.</p><p>We cook with care, serve with warmth and welcome every guest like an old friend. Pull up a chair — there's always room at our table.</p></section>
